00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,587
Covers like this surface every week in K-pop and vanish by Friday.

2
00:00:04,587 --> 00:00:06,108
This one did the opposite.

3
00:00:06,108 --> 00:00:11,868
It moved through TikTok and Twitter in translations, stitched and reacted to for weeks.

4
00:00:11,868 --> 00:00:14,729
And then it reached the one person whose song it was.

